UNOFFICIAL APP FOR PERSONAL USE ONLY
======================================================================

Gift Card Wallet is an independent app for managing Lidl Switzerland
gift cards. The app is intended strictly for personal use. It has no
affiliation with or endorsement from Lidl, Lidl Schweiz, or Schwarz Gruppe.

"Lidl", the Lidl logo, and all related names, brands, and trademarks
are the property of their respective owners and are used in this
project solely for identification purposes, describing what the app
works with. No endorsement is implied.

The app reads data from Lidl's public balance-check web page on behalf
of the user and stores gift-card data locally on the user's own device.
No data is collected, transmitted, or shared by the authors. Use of the
Lidl brand names by third parties in this repository does not constitute
a trademark infringement claim waiver or a license to use those marks.

